  "abstract": "Critically, Round 1 operates under a slashing intensity parameter set to zero: no REP is redistributed based on Round 1 outcomes. Under the terminology of Crawford and Sobel (1982), Round 1 functions as a cheap-talk round that elicits private information without economic commitment.",
